__pycache__
dist/
tent_pole.egg-info/
.doit.db

## Generated build products under dev/sample-course-python/ (see its README.md)
## -- source is tracked, these are rebuilt by `make`. No secret lives in
## this directory at all: tent-pole.toml only has [module], and the
## real target/credentials come from TENT_POLE_USE_TEST_CONFIG + your
## own global tent-pole.toml's [dev] section.
dev/sample-course-python/*.html
dev/sample-course-python/*.tpp
dev/sample-course-python/*.tpf
dev/sample-course-python/*.tpd
dev/sample-course-python/*.tpq
dev/sample-course-python/*.out
dev/sample-course-python/*.stout
dev/sample-course-python/*.crash
dev/sample-course-python/test-image.png
dev/sample-course-python/test-video.mp4

## Same, for dev/sample-course-r/ -- plus *.png, since every plot
## there is generated by r-chunks (demo_<chunk>-<n>.png), not checked
## in content the way a hand-authored image would be.
dev/sample-course-r/*.html
dev/sample-course-r/*.tpp
dev/sample-course-r/*.tpf
dev/sample-course-r/*.tpd
dev/sample-course-r/*.tpq
dev/sample-course-r/*.out
dev/sample-course-r/*.stout
dev/sample-course-r/*.crash
dev/sample-course-r/*.png
dev/sample-course-r/tent-pole.toml.tpm
